<title>AUSTRIA: Raiffeisen arranges credit line for Total.</title>
<headline>Raiffeisen arranges credit line for Total.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's Raiffeisen Zentralbank on Thursday said it was arranging a $60 million credit line with France's Societe Generale for French energy group Total to finance deliveries of Russian crude oil.</p>
<p>Raiffeisen was the only Austrian bank in a syndicate dominated by French banks, it said in a statement. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
